  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mtext>cos</mtext><mi>&#160;&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />&nbsp;<br /><img alt=\"\" height=\"186\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0007554_AnsExp1_1.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" width=\"172\" /><br />&nbsp;<br />The velocity of the ball at an angle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math> is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mtext>cos</mtext><mi>&#160;&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>g</mi></math>&nbsp; ...... (i)<br /><br />Let N be the normal reaction (away from the centre) at angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>. Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mg&#160;</mtext><mtext>cos</mtext><mi>&#160;&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math><br /><br />Substituting the value of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>&#957;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math> from equation (i), we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mg</mtext><mtext>&#160;cos</mtext><mi>&#160;&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>2</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mg</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mtext>cos</mtext><mi>&#160;&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mtext>3 cos</mtext><mi>&#160;&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
